  "content": "\n\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/fcgwZZjIG8c?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>The Alternative Rain Sounds</strong> 资源包使用更真实且富有氛围感的音效替换了原版下雨和打雷的声音。现在的雨声远比原版 Minecraft 的默认音效丰富。雷声也得到了更新，呈现出更加震撼和有力的效果。搭配本资源包，你将能更深地沉浸在游戏世界中。希望你能喜欢 :)</span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>常见问题：</strong></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">任何人都可以在自己的整合包中使用此资源包。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">授权信息与原始音效来源：</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixabay.com%252fsound-effects%252frain-and-thunder-nature-sounds-7803%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/rain-and-thunder-nature-sounds-7803/</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixabay.com%252fsound-effects%252fsoft-rain-ambient-111154%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/soft-rain-ambient-111154/</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixabay.com%252fsound-effects%252fnatural-thunder-113219%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/natural-thunder-113219/</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffreesound.org%252fpeople%252fbone666138%252fsounds%252f198857%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://freesound.org/people/bone666138/sounds/198857/</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixabay.com%252fsound-effects%252fthunder-24571%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/thunder-24571/</a></strong></span></p>",
